The Hugging Face model integration and mathematical evaluator include code
adapted from R-KV, released under the Apache License 2.0:

  R-KV: Redundancy-aware KV Cache Compression for Reasoning Models
  https://github.com/Zefan-Cai/R-KV
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.24133

The evaluator inherited by R-KV includes attribution to the Hendrycks MATH
release, Microsoft ProphetNet/CRITIC, OpenAI PRM800K, Microsoft ToRA, and
DeepSeek-Math. Those attributions are retained in
src/avokv/evaluation/grader.py.

No SGLang or vLLM source code is included in this repository.
